msgid ""
"Raised inside :meth:`WebSocket.receive` when the connection ends or the "
"protocol is violated. Use this in a route to detect normal client "
"disconnects::"
msgstr ""
"Se lanza dentro de :meth:`WebSocket.receive` cuando la conexión termina o se"
" viola el protocolo. Úselo en una ruta para detectar desconexiones normales "
"del cliente::"

